	(property "Design notes" "TO-92 pin numbering is 1 GND, 2 VIN, 3 VOUT. Wide 2.54 mm footprint requires forming the outer leads from nominal 1.27 mm spacing; support the body while forming. Budget 30 mA maximum total 3.3 V load. Include output, load and line regulation. Do not parallel existing ISOW7741 output."
